{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fast-paced top-down 2D Zombie Shooter with arcade elements. You control a lone survivor lost in a world full of zombies and strange creatures trying to uncover the mastermind behind all of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/gameplay.gif?t=1745471741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in action-packed shootouts from a top-down perspective. Collect supplies, craft items/weapons to defeat zombies and creatures as you progress through each level. Look for survivors and upgrade your camp to increase its capacity. Unlock more levels by defeating bosses you encounter.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/seasonchanges.gif?t=1745471741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey to the world of Zombies and Strangers with dynamic seasonal changes in environment. Experience each level on spring, summer, autumn or winter aesthetics and encounter different enemy types and bosses as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 2D pixel art, Zombies and Strangers offers a nostalgic, yet fresh visual style. it features dynamic effects, fluid pixel animations, and a wide range of enemy types. 2D top-down Environment ranges from towns, cities, rocky mountains and beaches. The game is designed with classic arcade aesthetics, along with fast-paced top-down action and colorful visual effects.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665670?t=1745471741","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/ae83177a640c4a56f2d0d45edeadc159ce40f195/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745471741","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/a500898f006ad22a8384a325601dc7fc49dc4b95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745471741","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/a500898f006ad22a8384a325601dc7fc49dc4b95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745471741","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains cartoon-styled violence and gore. \r\n\r\nAlthough the game is in 2D top-down perspective with cartoon-styled pixel graphics, players will engage in top-down shooting combat to defeat zombies and other creatures using different melee and ranged weapons. \r\n\r\nEnemies defeated may display unrealistic bright colored blood effects and cartoon-styled gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fast-paced top-down 2D Zombie Shooter with arcade elements. You control a lone survivor lost in a world full of zombies and strange creatures trying to uncover the mastermind behind all of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/gameplay.gif?t=1745471741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in action-packed shootouts from a top-down perspective. Collect supplies, craft items/weapons to defeat zombies and creatures as you progress through each level. Look for survivors and upgrade your camp to increase its capacity. Unlock more levels by defeating bosses you encounter.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/seasonchanges.gif?t=1745471741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey to the world of Zombies and Strangers with dynamic seasonal changes in environment. Experience each level on spring, summer, autumn or winter aesthetics and encounter different enemy types and bosses as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 2D pixel art, Zombies and Strangers offers a nostalgic, yet fresh visual style. it features dynamic effects, fluid pixel animations, and a wide range of enemy types. 2D top-down Environment ranges from towns, cities, rocky mountains and beaches. The game is designed with classic arcade aesthetics, along with fast-paced top-down action and colorful visual effects.</p>","developers":["jieasobi"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/286252f16bca3b4079c8083cb26bfc8d4f4c18c3/header.jpg?t=1745471741","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127066,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127066/movie480.mp4?t=1745471738","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127066/movie_max.mp4?t=1745471738"},"name":"Zombies and Strangers - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127066/e7a8748251813a9354ed15fa9eb9463f1cfb5f1a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745471738","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127066/movie480_